# Committed local-dev defaults. Non-sensitive only — see CLAUDE.md
# § "Local-dev env is committed; real secrets never are."
#
# The Supabase publishable key is deliberately NOT here. `bin/dev-run-web.sh`
# reads it out of `supabase status` at launch and exports it as
# PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, so nothing key-shaped is ever written to disk.
#
# Machine-local overrides go in a gitignored .env.development.local, which Vite
# loads last and which therefore wins. Don't edit this file for them.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54421
